### Obtener todos los clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients

### Obtener un cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/1

### Obtener un cliente (con error)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/1234

### Crear un nuevo cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Cristiano",
    "surname": "Ronaldo",
    "email": "cr7@mail.com",
    "doc": "doc3",
    "type_doc": "DNI",
    "password": "*ctr3*",
    "birth_date": "2026-07-03",
    "type_user": "Socio",
    "sports": [3]
}

### Crear otro cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lionel",
    "surname": "Messi",
    "email": "Messi@mail.com",
    "doc": "doc",
    "type_doc": "DNI",
    "password": "*ctr*",
    "birth_date": "2026-07-03",
    "type_user": "Socio",
    "sports": [3]
}



### Modificar a un cliente (PUT -> Recurso completo, idempotente)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/clients/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sports": [1,3]
}

### Modificar a un cliente (PUT -> Recurso parcial)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/clients/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "lm10@mail.com"
}

### Eliminar un cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/clients/36b8f84d-df4e-4d49-b662-bcde71a8764f